# Local-only docs (per-cycle working artifacts). Single rule: anything
# under docs/internal/ is local-only. Same convention applies to local
# dev-verification apparatus under phase-b/ — mock-plc.py is the
# exception: CI launches it as a fixture for the postgres smoke tests
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
docs/internal
phase-b/*
!phase-b/mock-plc.py
